      <p class="related-resources-title">Additional resources</p>
      <ul><li><a href="https://access.redhat.com/documentation/en-us/openshift_container_platform/4.15/html/hosted_control_planes/troubleshooting-hosted-control-planes#scale-down-data-plane_hcp-troubleshooting">Scaling down the data plane to zero</a></li></ul>
      </section>
      <h2 id="hcp-virt-verify-hc_hcp-deploy-virt" class="group scroll-mt-20">Verifying hosted cluster creation on OpenShift Virtualization<a href="#hcp-virt-verify-hc_hcp-deploy-virt" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">After you create a hosted cluster on OpenShift Virtualization, verify that it was successfully created.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Verify that the <code>HostedCluster</code> resource transitioned to the <code>completed</code> state by entering the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get --namespace clusters hostedclusters <hosted_cluster_name>"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"NAMESPACE   NAME      VERSION   KUBECONFIG                 PROGRESS    AVAILABLE   PROGRESSING   MESSAGE\nclusters    example   4.12.2    example-admin-kubeconfig   Completed   True        False         The hosted control plane is available"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Verify that all the cluster operators in the hosted cluster are online by entering the following commands:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ hcp create kubeconfig --name <hosted_cluster_name> \\\n  > <hosted_cluster_name>-kubeconfig"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get co --kubeconfig=<hosted_cluster_name>-kubeconfig"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"NAME                                       VERSION   AVAILABLE   PROGRESSING   DEGRADED   SINCE   MESSAGE\nconsole                                    4.12.2   True        False         False      2m38s\ncsi-snapshot-controller                    4.12.2   True        False         False      4m3s\ndns                                        4.12.2   True        False         False      2m52s\nimage-registry                             4.12.2   True        False         False      2m8s\ningress                                    4.12.2   True        False         False      22m\nkube-apiserver                             4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\nkube-controller-manager                    4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\nkube-scheduler                             4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\nkube-storage-version-migrator              4.12.2   True        False         False      4m52s\nmonitoring                                 4.12.2   True        False         False      69s\nnetwork                                    4.12.2   True        False         False      4m3s\nnode-tuning                                4.12.2   True        False         False      2m22s\nopenshift-apiserver                        4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\nopenshift-controller-manager               4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\nopenshift-samples                          4.12.2   True        False         False      2m15s\noperator-lifecycle-manager                 4.12.2   True        False         False      22m\noperator-lifecycle-manager-catalog         4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\noperator-lifecycle-manager-packageserver   4.12.2   True        False         False      23m\nservice-ca                                 4.12.2   True        False         False      4m41s\nstorage                                    4.12.2   True        False         False      4m43s"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      </ol>
